% backend: none
% expect-output: false
% expect-output: hello
% expect-output: true
% Scenario: LZWDecode read to its end. Nine-bit codes: a clear code,
% the five literals, and the end-of-data code. EarlyChange 0 reads the
% same short stream, whose width never changes.
% Expect: false, hello, true.
<801A0CA6C361BE02> /LZWDecode filter 100 string readstring = =
<801A0CA6C361BE02> << /EarlyChange 0 >> /LZWDecode filter
100 string readstring pop (hello) eq =
